DESCRIPTION:Roy Wood Jr. brings Strangers: Live to the Woodstock\, VT Town
  Hall Theatre\, for an evening of comedy\, conversation\, and unexpected e
 ncounters. The comedian and current host of CNN’s Have I Got News For Yo
 u will perform comedy and interview people from the community and stranger
 s from the audience\, turning the room itself into part of the show. A for
 mer correspondent for The Daily Show\, Wood has built a career around shar
 p observational comedy and conversations about the stories shaping America
 n life. Please note: This performance will be recorded. Pentangle Arts\n\n
 Sources: Vermont Public
