BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Vermont Safety & Health Council Fall Expo
DTSTART:20261027T080000
DTEND:20261027T153000
DTSTAMP:20261025T145849Z
UID:8849d68b8c343ecc10c38f96e920f8@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:Join us for the Vermont Safety and Health Council Fall Expo on
  October 27th at the beautiful Killington Grand Resort! Whether you’re a
  seasoned safety professional or just beginning to build your expertise\, 
 this full-day event is your gateway to the latest in workplace safety and 
 wellness. From expert-led sessions and hands-on “toolkit” takeaways to
  all day interactive wellness activities\, engaging vendor exhibits and pe
 er networking\, this is a can’t-miss opportunity to elevate your safety 
 game. We are excited to once again partner with the Governor’s Council o
 n Physical Fitness and Sports to host the 2026 Governor’s Excellence in 
 Worksite Wellness Awards! Welcome new faces and reconnect with familiar on
 es. Registration still open! A big thank you to our partners at Killington
  Grand Resort for hosting what promises to be an inspiring and impactful d
 ay. Speakers Include: https://vshc.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/2026-Wor
 kshops.pdf\n\nSources: Vermont Public
LOCATION:Killington Grand Hotel\, 228 East Mountain Road
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/vermont-sa
 fety-health-council-fall-expo-02-10-2026-14-04-47
END:VEVENT
